. Macau","x":"For example, our only competitors raised prices since we use their pricing umbrella to set our prices we follow them up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/29/heico-corp-hei-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2019 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2019-05-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor H. Mendelson","x":"So those are kind of the keys to us and those generally -- higher margin products though where we are interestingly enough, able to offer them at a very competitive price to our customers very often a cost saving price much less than their alternatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/29/heico-corp-hei-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2020-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Carlos L. Macau","x":"One of the benefits that I guess, HEICO is enjoying right now is that when Trump, President Trump put his tariffs on China, a lot of our guys that were sourcing product from that region had to find alternatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/heico-corp-hei-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"And I consider a near 17% organic increase in operating income to be a phenomenal achievement, especially since it was accomplished while maintaining our long-term minimal price increase model and keeping the loyalty and appreciation of our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/heico-corp-hei-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"Again, this was accomplished by maintaining our low-price increase model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/heico-corp-hei-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"And I can tell you, while I don't want to go into information on specific regions, countries, airlines or products, I can tell you that there is a significant increase in our cost-saving solutions at a number of customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/heico-corp-hei-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"We've seen historically whenever there is a supply demand imbalance that our customers become a lot more focused on cost-saving opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/heico-corp-hei-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2020-02-26","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Spingarn","x":"I mean, I think the incremental margin, 66%, if I'm doing the math right, and you did raise the guide and talked about the mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/heico-corp-hei-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2020-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurans A. Mendelson","x":"…impact from the outbreak, we at HEICO have implemented certain cost reductions, including layoffs, temporary reduced work hours, temporary pay reductions within various departments of our businesses; including [Technical Issues] our entire executive management team and our Board of…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/27/heico-corp-hei-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2020-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurans A. Mendelson","x":"Once commercial air travel resumes, cost savings will most likely be a priority for our commercial aviation customers and we do anticipate recovery in demand for our commercial aviation products, which frequently provide aircraft operators with significant cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/27/heico-corp-hei-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2020-05-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"We have to be careful because we have withdrawn guidance because we truly don't know what the numbers are going to be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/27/heico-corp-hei-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q3","e":"hei","d":"2020-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurans A. Mendelson","x":"In response to the economic impact from the outbreak, we at HEICO have implemented certain cost reduction efforts, including layoffs, temporary reduced work hours, temporary pay reductions within various departments of our business, including within our entire executive management team as well as…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/heico-corp-hei-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q3","e":"hei","d":"2020-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurans A. Mendelson","x":"…impact from the outbreak, we at HEICO have implemented certain cost reduction efforts, including layoffs, temporary reduced work hours, temporary pay reductions within various departments of our business, including within our entire executive management team as well as our Board of Directors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/heico-corp-hei-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q4","e":"hei","d":"2020-12-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laurans A. Mendelson","x":"…'21 as demand for air travel slowly recovers, we remained very confident in our ability to offer cost saving solutions and robust product development programs that we expect to increase our market share and allow us to have even a stronger presence within the commercial aviation market. I'd like","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/22/heico-corp-hei-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2020 Q4","e":"hei","d":"2020-12-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"There were some layoffs and we wanted to be sensitive to make sure that, if you will, the pain was -- the sacrifice was throughout the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/22/heico-corp-hei-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2021 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2021-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"The OEMs have been pretty aggressive with price increases, and we're just trying to take our little piece, and I think their business models are very much intact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/heico-corp-hei-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2021 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2021-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"And so we moderate price increases for them if they commit to us for a long period of time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/heico-corp-hei-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2021 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"Our team members engaged primarily in commercial aviation sacrificed greatly during the pandemic through limited layoffs, moderate furloughs and wage reductions for nearly all others not impacted by layoffs or furloughs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/heico-corp-hei-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2021 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"They're relying on us to deliver cost savings, and I think that we're going to be in a very unique position going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/heico-corp-hei-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2021 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"What we did was we had limited layoffs, and we also had furloughs, some of which were voluntary, and then for those who remained on the aftermarket space, we all took voluntary pay cuts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/heico-corp-hei-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2021 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"In looking at some of our numbers, the larger layoffs did occur in our specialty products area, which are non-aftermarket facing businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/heico-corp-hei-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2021 Q4","e":"hei","d":"2021-12-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor H. Mendelson","x":"I'll just make a comment, too, because the natural follow-on to that is, well, are you seeing price increases on your components and on your material.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/17/heico-corporation-hei-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"HEI 2021 Q4","e":"hei","d":"2021-12-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor H. Mendelson","x":"Sometimes those price increases are fairly low.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/17/heico-corporation-hei-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"HEI 2024 Q3","e":"hei","d":"2024-08-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric Mendelson","x":"We've been very firm about passing along our price increases to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2024 Q3","e":"hei","d":"2024-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Mendelson","x":"That's when customers realize that they've got to take advantage of our additional cost savings, parts and repairs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2024 Q3","e":"hei","d":"2024-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos Macau","x":"Again, as Eric talked earlier, we don't really have knee-jerk reactions at HEICO if one of our businesses is having a challenge in any particular quarter or year, unless it is something that we believe will last a lifetime, we don't ask them to right-size their business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2024 Q4","e":"hei","d":"2024-12-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Mendelson","x":"HEICO has always been about finding cost savings or best cost solutions for our customers, whether they're defense or commercial customers, and not about getting the highest price out of them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2024 Q4","e":"hei","d":"2024-12-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Mendelson","x":"When you look at the budget deficit and the amount of money that has to be cut, there are tremendous cost savings opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2025-02-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Carlos Macau","x":"We think it could be anywhere from net-net 3% to 5% increased our product cost, assuming that there was a tariff on half the countries we do business with, and I think if that was the case, we’d have no problem passing it on to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2025-02-27","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ron Epstein","x":"How are you guys thinking about tariffs, given how global supply chains are in commercial aero?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2025-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Noah Poponak","x":"I wanted to follow up on the pricing question because a few quarters ago, we had talked on here about, it’s not the number one weapon in your arsenal necessarily for expanding profitability and creating value, but it is an industry with pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2025-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Noah Poponak","x":"And then some of your peers and companies in the OEM parts have had price increases well above the historical average recently in the inflationary window we’ve been in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2025-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Mendelson","x":"Our customers want additional cost savings, products and services and it’s really taking hold very well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q1","e":"hei","d":"2025-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor Mendelson","x":"But as you pointed out, our focus has always been on cost-saving solutions for the customers where we provide some lower cost alternative than to what they could do otherwise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2025-05-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eric Mendelson","x":"China, there was a little bit of pre-buying, before the tariff, and then there were periods where it was lower.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2025-05-28","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Kristen Liwag","x":"Did you see some sort of customer pull forward in anticipation of tariffs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2025-05-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Victor Mendelson","x":"We have explained to them that we've got to push through and pass through our price increases, you know, our cost increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2025-05-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Victor Mendelson","x":"But we've been very, very careful to not use this as a profit grab to raise prices indiscriminately.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2025-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Mendelson","x":"I am very happy with the continued expansion of our cash margin and believe our efficient and decentralized operating structure has permitted us to expand these margins as we simultaneously delight our customers with cost savings and lightning quick turnaround times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q2","e":"hei","d":"2025-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Victor Mendelson","x":"It's a combination of the cost-saving opportunities for the airlines, us having parts on the shelves, customers agreeing that we can develop product at a more rapid pace than we have in the past.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/heico-hei-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HEI 2025 Q3","e":"hei","d":"2025-08-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Eric A. Mendelson","x":"So our philosophy always has been and our customers understand nobody wants a price increase.